{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（24日）早上8時29分，警方接報青馬大橋往機場方向有三車相撞，包括一部的士和兩部私家車，有司機不適。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，青嶼幹線（青馬大橋）（往機場方向） 的快線仍然封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車，青嶼幹線下層（往機場方向）現已開放，現時上址交通擠塞。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:34:26.878941+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T00:54:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:28.676311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:28:00.927867+00:00","content_hash":"25b003f9903d868be82cc698bf477f09dd7b1b1c895d07598a5f239680a58bcd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}